      "audioFile": "ghost_match_start_viper_ghost_convo01_02",
      "audioUrl": "audio/ghost_match_start_viper_ghost_convo01_02.mp3",
      "text": "Why do you ask, it's not like you could afford them.",
      "duration": 4.067
    },
    {
      "order": 3,
      "character": "Vyper",
      "audioFile": "viper_match_start_viper_ghost_convo01_03",
      "audioUrl": "audio/viper_match_start_viper_ghost_convo01_03.mp3",
      "text": "So it's sounding like off your dead body.",
